WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:38.940
Axis's flagship, the Sadalahn,
is in geosynchronous orbit.

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:41.180
I was invited aboard it!

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:47.420
That Haman woman--no,
MISS Haman--wanted to size me up!

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:50.120
She must've thought I was
a first-class Newtype or something.

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:57.220
But all I cared about was finding Leina...
and that woman tricked me!

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:03.900
THE BURNING EARTH

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.880
Elpeo Ple... do you
hear me, Elpeo Ple?

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:29.640
Elpeo Ple... your enemy is the Gundam.

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:30.740
Gundam?

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:34.460
That's right. The Gundam is
the enemy you must defeat.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:37.870
And the pilot of that
Gundam is Judau Ashta.

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:39.810
Judau Ashta.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:43.100
Judau is... my big brother!

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.410
He's not! Judau is your enemy!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.680
J-J-Judau is my enemy!

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.740
Someone I'm supposed to hate...?

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.840
Awaken, Elpeo Ple.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:48.560
If she's going to be able to fight,
I can let her stop now.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:49.590
How is she?

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:54.060
The imprinting process is complete.
Only the combat test remains.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.840
Understood. We'll stop here, then.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.140
I'll have her rest up in sick bay.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.100
No, I'm going to take
her to see Lady Haman.

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:01.690
Revive her immediately.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:05.350
That's dangerous! Her mind and body
are both completely exhausted!

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:08.360
Aren't you a doctor? You should
be able to deal with that.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.510
S-Sure!

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.610
The Earth is right there.

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.000
We have no time!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:13.770
Leina?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:15.910
I got lost!

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:18.880
Which lesson did you
sneak out of this time?

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.520
I didn't.

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:24.670
When we land on Earth.... you'll be
making your debut in high society.

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:26.040
Okay.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.310
Is something wrong with that girl?

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.990
It seems she's a bit anemic.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:33.480
Now, off to your lesson!

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.880
Everyone seems to be working hard.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.350
Yeah, this is a ton of effort.

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:00.190
What are they fighting for?
I wonder if they even know.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:02.780
Beecha! Mondo! Stop slacking!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.520
Hey, we're busy thinking
some serious stuff here!

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.710
Oh?

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.110
Captain!

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:10.410
I'd like to hear your
serious opinions, then.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.780
It's not that we don't want to fight.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.340
But we just don't get what we're
supposed to be fighting for.

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:17.280
That's cheeky!

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.610
Shut your mouth!

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:21.350
Would saving the Earth be
a good enough reason?

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:23.800
But we're Spacenoids.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.540
So am I.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:28.810
But Earth is where all of us
originally came from.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:34.890
It's our duty to keep those who've never
left Earth for space from defiling it.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:38.700
But Judau's only doing anything
because he wants to save his sister.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.320
We don't have any reasons like that.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:44.260
This may sound harsh, but if you
want to survive, you have to fight.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.720
You can't turn back now.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.680
We're thinking of leaving the
Argama once we land on Earth.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.860
I won't stop you.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.220
Do you have a minute?

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:56.560
Sorry, but I'm busy.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:58.030
If you have something to say--

00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:59.300
Hold on!

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:01.540
Judau...

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.270
Do you resent me?

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:05.920
Are you screwing with me?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.600
I'm completely serious.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:08.670
S-Sorry.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.650
Because we dragged you
into battle, Leina was...

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.930
That's why I'm doing
my best to rescue her.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.380
When you do, will the two
of you leave this ship?

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:20.560
I don't think that far ahead!

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:22.030
Judau!

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:25.120
We have to put a ballute
on the Double Zeta, right?

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.260
You're a worrywart, Captain.

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:29.470
You think so?

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:32.500
Even after he rescues Leina,
Judau won't leave the Argama.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.620
Why is that?

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:37.470
He's the type who feels like he
has to bear everyone's burdens.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:39.280
He's sincere.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.900
But can he handle being a pilot?

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.160
He'll understand there's no choice.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.430
That's right, Captain!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.420
He may be laid-back,
but Judau's not stupid.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.060
He's never satisfied unless he
sees things through to the end.

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:54.130
True. Maybe he'll actually
settle down once he saves Leina.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:56.780
So stop worrying like an old man.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:07:00.100
Roux, you were a
volunteer soldier, right?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:03.340
Yes. I believe the
AEUG's cause is just.

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:04.680
So do I.

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:08.090
Otherwise, we wouldn't be
able to fight as we do.

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:28.380
If it isn't Lady Haman.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.160
Thank you for coming here.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.750
Thank you for your
hard work, Glemy Toto.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.060
Ma'am!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.600
This is the girl.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.990
The pilot of the Qubeley Mk. II.

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:41.030
This is Elpeo Ple?

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.450
I hear she's a Newtype.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:46.170
I am sure she will become a valuable
asset to you, Lady Haman.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.810
I look forward to it.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:53.980
I was afraid your ship
wouldn't arrive, Glemy.

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:55.940
Why would you think such a thing?

00:07:55.940 --> 00:08:00.140
By going down to Earth, I've weakened
Axis's defenses accordingly.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:03.390
If you thought I'd take advantage of that by
taking over Axis's defenses for myself,

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:05.000
then you've overestimated me.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.670
I'm concerned about Axis,
but it can be rebuilt.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:10.320
There's only one of you, Lady Haman.

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.500
How do you know there's only one?

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.810
You must be joking.

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:16.440
We have many enemies.
One can't be too careful.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.410
I will remain by your side.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.150
Once we land on Earth,
I'll introduce you as my aide

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.840
to the snobs who
govern the Federation.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:24.370
Ma'am!

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.180
I am honored!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.320
Manage Glemy's bodyguards carefully.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.770
So the enemy is targeting
Dakar, after all.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:41.840
They must be aiming to march right into
the Federation assembly and seize control.

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:44.140
They take the Federation government
so lightly, don't they?

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.210
Captain! Incoming
communication from Karaba!

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:50.730
Decrypting... it says that Dakar has already
been infiltrated by a number of Axis spies.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:54.240
The Earth Federation assembly's
current session has stalled...

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.610
and they've voted to extend it.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:00.140
Axis has effectively
taken control of Dakar?!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.570
What?!

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.130
Captain!

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:08.100
Not bad, Haman...

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:10.360
So you've already set the stage...?

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.760
Okay, everyone, it's chow time--

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:18.460
Guys, what's wrong?

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:19.560
Here!

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:21.300
How's maintenance on the Gundam going?

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.520
Just waiting for launch orders!

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:25.270
Go after the Sadalahn!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.430
Just as I'd expect, Captain.
You don't let anything go.

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:30.430
Well, I don't actually know which
of the three ships is the Sadalahn.

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:32.860
Leina has to be somewhere
near the Sadalahn...

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:36.240
No, the one in front must be
the Sadalahn after all!

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.390
All right! Sound the alarms!

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.900
All hands, level 1 battle stations!

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:43.450
Scan for enemies from every angle!
We don't know where they're hiding!

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:46.460
Judau, how are you going to find Leina?

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:49.120
By preventing the enemy
ships from landing on Earth.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.380
But how?

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:54.290
If I destroy their ballutes, they won't
be able to enter the atmosphere.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.710
Wouldn't it be easier if you
waited until after they landed?

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:00.190
If I keep making excuses like that,
I'll never be able to rescue her.

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:02.610
True... I've got your back!

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.080
Thanks, man!

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:08.050
Leina should be in one
of the two escort ships...

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:11.350
Is Judau okay? Is Judau okay?

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.890
Zeta Gundam is the most
maneuverable, so...

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:14.840
Roux!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.300
What?

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.900
I promise I'll bring it back!

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.690
Until then, I want you
to use the Double Zeta!

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.830
You're being pretty selfish!

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.110
Miss Roux, c'mon, please.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.020
Just this once, let Judau
do what he wants.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.070
You know--

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:28.230
Please.

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:31.540
Fine. You want me to launch
in the Double Zeta, right?

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.340
Jeez!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.570
Thank you.

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:38.290
Judau Ashta, Zeta Gundam, here I go!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.060
Master Glemy, the Argama has
entered the combat zone.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.280
The Argama is on the move?

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:59.100
Where are you going, Elpeo Ple?

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.520
The enemy is coming, so I must fight.

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:03.060
Can you do it?

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.230
It is my duty. I must.

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.970
What is Judau Ashta to you?

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.040
Judau is...

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.910
Answer me, Elpeo Ple!

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.580
Judau Ashta is... my enemy.

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:16.720
All right! Go!

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:17.870
Yes, sir!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.890
I didn't expect the hypnotherapy
to work this well.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:24.760
The remaining problem is
her synchronization with the psycommu.

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:27.110
Launch all units of the Zssa team!

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:30.470
After launch, the Sandra will turn
180 degrees and intercept the Argama!

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:31.500
Yes, sir!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.350
I will launch in the Bawoo as well.
I'll leave the bridge to you.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:38.240
If necessary, you can go ahead
and enter the atmosphere.

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:49.010
What's this? All this shaking...

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.830
Now, once again, from the beginning.

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:59.300
Okay.

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:22.770
I guess Haman has started to suspect me.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:27.980
My position will be in danger if I don't
prove my usefulness right about now.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:32.280
Okay, I'll hold off the
enemy's mobile suits.

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:35.030
The Zssa team should think
only of sinking the Argama!

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:46.180
I feel him... He's very
close now... Judau Ashta!

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:53.020
They're here! Axis's mobile suits!

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:54.730
What?!

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:03.030
A Qubeley! Is that Elpeo Ple?!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.280
You're still piloting?

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:25.220
She seems to be doing well.
Now, how far can she go?

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:29.170
Why can't you launch?!

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:31.510
I'm not chicken!
I'm just not convinced yet.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:32.260
What's wrong?

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:33.300
Elle?!

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:36.260
It's way too late for him to say
he doesn't want to launch!

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:37.600
Wait, you're doing what?

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.930
Look, the adults started
this war on their own.

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:43.850
So why do us kids have
to fight to save their asses?!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:47.270
Isn't rescuing Leina a good
enough reason for you?

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.770
Both Leina and Judau are our friends!

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.420
Hurry, you should be on standby!

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:52.990
The hell with you, outsider!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.820
Beecha, you're a jerk!

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:56.800
Elle?!

00:13:56.800 --> 00:14:00.830
You're just stubborn and selfish,
no matter how old you get!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:04.540
I don't like you, so I hate
to admit it, but you're right.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:05.510
Huh?

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:09.670
We're lousy adults for pushing women
and children onto the battlefield.

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:10.710
What are you doing?

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:12.170
I'll fly the Hyaku Shiki.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:15.640
Even I know enough to
make a mobile suit work!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:18.390
Mr. Tragier... you can't!

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:19.010
The Hyaku Shiki...

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:19.850
Beecha?!

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.350
...is MINE!

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:25.120
A good mobile suit isn't worth
anything in the hands of a bad pilot.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.570
You're one unruly punk, but...

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:31.280
Double Zeta, Roux Louka, moving out!

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:39.750
Elle Vianno, Gundam Mk. II, moving out!

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:50.210
Enemy mobile suits approaching.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:52.000
They're Zssas!

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:53.920
What's the launch status
of the Gundam Team?

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.310
Double Zeta and Mk. II have deployed,
and Hyaku Shiki is launching!

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:01.020
Beecha Oleg, Hyaku Shiki, moving out!

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:09.730
Elle! Why are you crawling
along like this?

00:15:09.730 --> 00:15:11.270
Beecha! You joined us?!

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:14.870
It beats waiting to get
shot down on the Argama.

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:21.410
Ple, stop it!

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.130
Don't you recognize me?

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:25.250
In front, too?

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:30.760
The Zeta Gundam?! Wasn't Ple
chasing the Double Zeta?

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:34.500
Zeta Gundam!
Is your pilot Roux Louka?!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.670
Sorry to disappoint!
This is Judau Ashta!

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.010
Judau Ashta?!

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:39.880
You must be the one
manipulating Ple's head!

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.190
What?!

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.930
Don't let him escape!
Follow him, Elpeo Ple!

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:53.360
Can I shake them off and save Leina?

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:57.910
Is that it?

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.410
One more minute until atmospheric entry.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:09.310
Secure all blocks.

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:12.380
Enemy mobile suit-- no,
mobile armor approaching!

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.610
What?!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:15.220
Incoming!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.840
What is the Sandra doing?!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.430
Begin the entry, quickly!

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.140
Which is it?

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:27.560
Leina! Tell me!

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:29.230
Big Brother!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.530
Leina!

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:34.770
Leina! That one?

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.620
What?!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:42.740
Was it you who just called for me?!

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.960
You're going down, Judau!

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:48.340
Th-This again?!

00:16:57.270 --> 00:16:59.460
All blocks have been secured.

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:02.760
The Argama isn't pursuing us.
The Sandra is holding them off.

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:05.050
- Five seconds till entry.
- Glemy... you're doing pretty well.

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.140
- Four... three...
- Glemy... you're doing pretty well.

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:10.980
Two... one... opening ballute!

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:35.170
It seems two enemy ships
have begun atmospheric entry.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.040
And the cannons?!

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.680
We won't make it in time!

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:42.390
What are the gunners doing?!

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:49.970
Elle, Beecha! The Double Zeta can
take care of the rest.

00:17:49.970 --> 00:17:51.720
Go and back Judau up!

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:55.940
Are you going to be all right, Roux?

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.520
We'll let you take care of the Argama!

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:58.610
Leave it to me!

00:17:58.610 --> 00:17:59.610
Let's go, Beecha!

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:00.870
All right!

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:05.620
I'll show you just how much
more power the Double Zeta has!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:18.590
All right! Just try and stop me!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:25.020
Dammit! I'm gonna
have to take a gamble!

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:32.930
Let go!

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:35.730
Ple! Don't you want to
eat a chocolate parfait?

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.730
Chocolate parfait..?

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:43.150
Don't you want to remember
that sweet taste, Ple?

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:46.910
D-Damn you! W-What kind
of joke are you--

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:52.620
Don't things taste better when
people eat them together,

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:53.580
Ple?

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:57.800
B-Big brother?

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:00.060
Elpeo Ple!

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:02.220
I'm glad you opened this hatch!

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.470
Judau Ashta!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:08.680
Judau Ashta is my--

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:12.940
Wow, they seriously
imprinted on her.

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:15.110
You are my enemy!

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:18.770
Put that down, and you can
come with your big brother.

00:19:18.770 --> 00:19:20.410
We'll have parfaits.

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:21.610
Big Brother?

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.570
Elpeo Ple! What are you doing?!

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:30.970
Elpeo Ple! Gravity is
going to pull you in!

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:34.000
Was it you?! The one who
made Ple this way?!

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:37.170
Now fall, Zeta!

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:43.470
Curses!

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:47.890
Ple!

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:50.770
What the--

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:53.100
Judau!

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:54.550
Are you alive?!

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.610
Reinforcements from the Argama?!

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.690
It won't stop!

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.450
Someone, come stop me!

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:05.270
Elpeo Ple!

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:07.160
Survive it if you're lucky!

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.200
I'm scared!

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:13.090
Help me, Judau!

00:20:13.090 --> 00:20:15.030
Ple! You know who I am?!

00:20:15.030 --> 00:20:17.510
Save me! Make it stop!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:19.550
All right! Just you wait!

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:24.960
What's happening?!

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.170
I'm burning up!

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:29.770
Big Brother! I'm scared!
I'm gonna burn up!

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:37.790
Hold your current altitude!
You can do it, Ple!

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.060
B-B-Big Brother!

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:40.600
Land on my back!

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.440
Got that? Look closely!

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:43.990
Y-Yeah.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:50.280
I don't think I can stabilize this.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.200
Why haven't the wings burned off?

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.450
Ple! Detach your wings!

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.120
Otherwise, neither
of us will survive!

00:20:57.120 --> 00:21:00.540
I-I can't! It's not
built that way!

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.120
Do you want to die in fear?

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:05.510
N-N-No!

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:13.890
We're stabilizing.

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:16.480
But, Leina...

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:22.810
10 seconds until atmospheric entry.

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:25.030
All hands, make anti-G preparations!

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:27.820
Big Brother...

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:38.580
H-Hey, this is real gravity!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:40.860
We're falling!

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:44.870
Earth's such a gigantic ball of water...

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:47.130
Open your ballute! We're at our limit!

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:48.050
S-Sure!

00:21:56.530 --> 00:21:58.930
Atmospheric entry angle is fixed.

00:21:58.930 --> 00:22:00.680
Friction heat is critical!

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:01.720
Open the ballute!

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:02.780
Yes, sir!

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:20.670
The Earth...

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:48.190 --> 00:23:52.230
Even people who look honest
turn out to be Axis puppets.

00:23:52.230 --> 00:23:56.070
The siblings Taman and Anu may
be victims of war, too.

00:23:56.070 --> 00:24:00.540
But there are times when you have to take
responsibility and settle things yourself.

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:04.340
Can I do it like Taman did?

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:09.210
Next time on Gundam ZZ:
"Sibling Love Blooms in the Southern Seas."

00:24:05.700 --> 00:24:08.830
SIBLING LOVE BLOOMS IN THE SOUTHERN SEAS

00:24:05.700 --> 00:24:08.830
Next Time
